    "note": "third reader: as passed by its first chamber (Senate third reading). Also adds unfinished frames or receivers to the firearm definition (§ 5–101(h)) and dealer license suspension/revocation (§ 5–114), not quoted. Amendments struck the earlier registration-by-owner duty and penalty section, changed the date from January to March 1, 2023, and added 30-day grace periods and the $150,000 appropriation. Section 3 (uncodified) says the Act is to be construed consistently with a proposed federal rule. Amendments made after the version read are not in the text read."
